# Secrets and sensitive data
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
*.p12
*.pfx
.env
.env.local

# NOTE: secrets.yaml is deliberately ABSENT from this file. It is SOPS-
# encrypted (see .sops.yaml) — ciphertext at rest — and is meant to be
# committed alongside the code that consumes it; .gitleaks.toml allowlists it
# for the same reason. Ignoring it here would silently prevent it from ever
# being committed. Only the age PRIVATE key and any DECRYPTED copy must stay
# out, which is what the two rules below cover.

# age private key — lives at ~/.config/sops/age/keys.txt, but guard against
# a stray copy landing in the repo.
*.agekey
keys.txt

# Any accidental decrypted output of secrets.yaml
*.decrypted
*.dec.yaml
secrets.dec.yaml

# mise — per-machine overrides (PACKER_HTTP_INTERFACE behind a VPN, another
# node). The tracked mise.toml must work without it.
mise.local.toml
.mise.local.toml
# direnv is gone (replaced by mise); keep stray leftovers out.
.envrc
.envrc.local
.direnv/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
.cache/

# OS specific
Thumbs.db

homelab-proxmox-core

*.pub
